th, td { border: 1px solid #9aa5b4; padding: 4pt 8pt; text-align: left; }
</style></head>
<body><h1>Capelli Sport — CS Certification Exam · Set 3</h1>
<p><strong>Name: ____________________   Date: __________   Score: ______ / 100</strong></p>
<p>Closed book. Answer in the voice of the agent handling the ticket. For each scenario, state <strong>how you handle it</strong> (route + action) and <strong>the one trap</strong> that would fail the ticket. <strong>Section A — 6 points each; Section B (multiple choice) — 2 points each. Total 100.</strong></p>
<hr>
<p><strong>Q1.</strong> <em>"USPS says my order was returned to sender. I never moved — why did it come back and how do I get it?"</em> What do you do?</p>
<p><strong>Q2.</strong> <em>"When I ordered, the item said 3–7 days. Now I'm being told it's a pre-order that takes 3–6 weeks. That's not what was advertised."</em> How do you respond, and how do you explain the timelines?</p>
<p><strong>Q3.</strong> <em>"Our whole team got our kits, but the sponsor logos on them belong to a different club — not ours."</em> How do you handle a decoration error that affects an entire team?</p>
<p><strong>Q4.</strong> <em>"I want to return just the shorts from my son's mandatory kit — they're too big — and keep the rest."</em> What's the policy on returning a single item from a mandatory package?</p>
<p><strong>Q5.</strong> <em>"Please cancel my order from capellisport.com and refund me — I ordered by mistake."</em> Handle this Shopify cancellation, including the refund timing you quote.</p>
<p><strong>Q6.</strong> <em>"I have two kids on the same team and one account. How do I order both of their kits together?"</em> Give the step-by-step.</p>
<p><strong>Q7.</strong> <em>"I just placed the package and the number assigned is 68, but my son's number is 16. Can you change it?"</em> What do you do, and what has to happen first?</p>
<p><strong>Q8.</strong> <em>"Is the navy training top I want ever coming back? I've been checking for weeks."</em> The item has been discontinued and will not be replenished. How do you respond?</p>
<p><strong>Q9. Spot the mistake.</strong> A teammate drafted this reply — identify <strong>every</strong> thing wrong with it:</p>
<blockquote><em>"Hi — I've emailed Dan and we're awaiting BD's approval on your replacement. PLS DO NOT RESPOND, this is being handled internally on Wave #77."</em></blockquote>
<p>List each error and give the corrected customer-facing message.</p>
<p><strong>Q10. Repeat defect.</strong> <em>"This is the SECOND time. You sent the replacement and the number is crooked and peeling again — exact same problem as the first one."</em> How do you handle a replacement that came back with the same defect?</p>
<hr>
<h2>Section B — Multiple Choice (Q11–Q30)</h2>
<p>Choose the single best answer. 2 points each.</p>
<p><strong>11.</strong> "No direct exchange" means the process is:</p>
<ul><li>A) Swap sizes on our end</li><li>B) Store credit only</li><li>C) Return for a refund, then place a new order</li><li>D) Keep both items</li></ul>
<p><strong>12.</strong> Which condition makes an item <strong>ineligible</strong> for return?</p>
<ul><li>A) It is unworn</li><li>B) It has been worn/washed or is missing tags</li><li>C) It is in the original box</li><li>D) It was recently bought</li></ul>
<p><strong>13.</strong> Cancelling an order is possible only if it is:</p>
<ul><li>A) Already shipped</li><li>B) Delivered</li><li>C) Personalized</li><li>D) Not yet fulfilled/processing</li></ul>
<p><strong>14.</strong> A player link that <strong>is</strong> in our database — you:</p>
<ul><li>A) Refuse</li><li>B) Provide the link</li><li>C) Send another parent's link</li><li>D) Escalate it</li></ul>
<p><strong>15.</strong> Team-store access problems are resolved by:</p>
<ul><li>A) A Capelli password reset</li><li>B) Sharing the password</li><li>C) Directing the customer to their coach/club admin</li><li>D) Creating a new account</li></ul>
<p><strong>16.</strong> The quality-issue opener references:</p>
<ul><li>A) A discount</li><li>B) "a strict line of quality checks" the item "slipped past"</li><li>C) The return address</li><li>D) The RO number</li></ul>
<p><strong>17.</strong> Marked "delivered" but not received — first step:</p>
<ul><li>A) Instant reship</li><li>B) Verify address + carrier scan; consider a claim</li><li>C) Refund</li><li>D) Close the ticket</li></ul>
<p><strong>18.</strong> International orders require:</p>
<ul><li>A) A US address</li><li>B) A PayPal account + the customer pays customs/duties</li><li>C) Nothing special</li><li>D) A club password</li></ul>
<p><strong>19.</strong> The military discount is:</p>
<ul><li>A) 25% off</li><li>B) Free shipping</li><li>C) 10% off the first order (with proof)</li><li>D) Not offered</li></ul>
<p><strong>20.</strong> Current promo codes/discounts:</p>
<ul><li>A) 10% sitewide</li><li>B) None currently; suggest the newsletter</li><li>C) Ask a manager</li><li>D) Only military</li></ul>
<p><strong>21.</strong> A customer ordered youth by mistake instead of adult:</p>
<ul><li>A) Exchange it</li><li>B) Return for refund + reorder</li><li>C) Reship free</li><li>D) It's non-returnable</li></ul>
<p><strong>22.</strong> The "add items" one-time courtesy: after they place a new order, you:</p>
<ul><li>A) Merge the orders</li><li>B) Refund the new order's shipping</li><li>C) Cancel the old order</li><li>D) Do nothing</li></ul>
<p><strong>23.</strong> In-stock shipping timeline (after processing):</p>
<ul><li>A) 1–3 business days</li><li>B) 3 weeks</li><li>C) 5 weeks</li><li>D) Same day</li></ul>
<p><strong>24.</strong> A gift certificate is redeemable at:</p>
<ul><li>A) Any store</li><li>B) teams.capellisport.com (plus equipment/fitness links)</li><li>C) Outlets only</li><li>D) PayPal</li></ul>
<p><strong>25.</strong> The size chart is found by:</p>
<ul><li>A) Emailing CS</li><li>B) Clicking the item image and scrolling to the last gallery image</li><li>C) The site footer</li><li>D) The club admin</li></ul>
<p><strong>26.</strong> Applying patches at home is:</p>
<ul><li>A) Recommended with a standard iron directly on the patch</li><li>B) Not recommended; use a heat press or test with a cloth first</li><li>C) Only possible with dry cleaning</li><li>D) Never possible</li></ul>
<p><strong>27.</strong> Do NOT merge a new ticket into:</p>
<ul><li>A) A pending ticket</li><li>B) An old solved ticket</li><li>C) A duplicate</li><li>D) Any ticket</li></ul>
<p><strong>28.</strong> Which is an internal-only term never sent to customers?</p>
<ul><li>A) UPS</li><li>B) OBD / Wave #</li><li>C) The tracking number</li><li>D) The return policy</li></ul>
<p><strong>29.</strong> When closing a ticket after multiple no-responses, you note that:</p>
<ul><li>A) Nothing further</li><li>B) If no response, the item will be cancelled</li><li>C) The RO number</li><li>D) The club password</li></ul>
<p><strong>30.</strong> A Pending ticket should not be closed before:</p>
<ul><li>A) 1 attempt</li><li>B) 5 attempts</li><li>C) The third attempt</li><li>D) A refund</li></ul></body></html>